vendor/sqlite3.mjs, vendor/sqlite3.wasm, vendor/sqlite3.d.mts
==============================================================

Source: npm package @sqlite.org/sqlite-wasm 3.53.4-build1
        https://registry.npmjs.org/@sqlite.org/sqlite-wasm/-/sqlite-wasm-3.53.4-build1.tgz
        (dist/index.mjs -> sqlite3.mjs, dist/sqlite3.wasm -> sqlite3.wasm, dist/index.d.mts -> sqlite3.d.mts)
Upstream: https://github.com/sqlite/sqlite-wasm (wrapper) and https://sqlite.org/wasm (SQLite Wasm build)

1. SQLite and the SQLite Wasm/JS build (sqlite3.wasm and the JavaScript API
   inside sqlite3.mjs) are in the public domain. From https://sqlite.org/copyright.html:

